                                                "sense_id": "2987afea-cd9c-3371-8cf7-b3e7029592da",
                                                "text": "She stains the ripest virgins of her age."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2e8a5330-5271-47df-ba69-89e41abe3435",
